#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "A Redis object-cache activation is already pending verification."
msgstr "Redis 物件快取的啟用操作已在等待驗證。"

#: includes/class-yperf-product-progress.php
msgid "A YPerf optimization is enabled and proven"
msgstr "YPerf 最佳化已啟用並通過驗證"

#: includes/class-yperf-migration-journey.php
msgid "A clean baseline was captured before migration."
msgstr "遷移前已儲存乾淨的基準狀態。"

#: includes/class-yperf-ai-advisor.php
msgid ""
"A clean current-version Runtime Acceptance is required before AI-assisted"
" configuration can be applied."
msgstr "應用 AI 輔助設定前，需要一份當前版本且通過全部檢查的執行階段驗收報告。"

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-operation-contract.php
msgid ""
"A clean current-version Runtime Acceptance is required before the R3 "
"object-cache activation can be approved."
msgstr "批准 R3 物件快取啟用前，需要一份當前版本且通過全部檢查的執行階段驗收報告。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A compact guide for the provider workflow. No Cloudflare expertise is "
"required."
msgstr "服務供應商操作流程的簡明指南。無需具備 Cloudflare 專業知識。"

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid ""
"A drop-in exists but WordPress did not confirm an active external object "
"cache."
msgstr "檢測到直通檔案，但 WordPress 未確認外部物件快取處於活動狀態。"

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid ""
"A drop-in exists. Ownership must be known before YPerf adopts page "
"caching."
msgstr "檢測到直通檔案。YPerf 接管頁面快取之前，必須確認其管理歸屬。"

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid "A feature depending on this extension may be limited."
msgstr "依賴此擴展的功能可能受到限制。"

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed and automatic rollback could not be "
"confirmed. Stop and review the cache artifact before continuing."
msgstr "熱快取命中測試失敗，且無法確認自動復原是否成功。請先停止操作並檢查快取檔案。"

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed during stability measurement. The new "
"activation was rolled back automatically."
msgstr "穩定性測量期間熱快取命中測試失敗。新啟用的快取已自動復原。"

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A hot-cache HIT sample failed while re-proving an existing executor. The "
"pre-existing cache was not removed automatically and requires review."
msgstr "重新驗證現有執行器時，熱快取命中測試失敗。系統沒有自動刪除原有快取，需要人工檢查。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A local under-the-hood report that combines WordPress, runtime, cache, "
"application and acceptance evidence. Nothing is sent remotely."
msgstr "一份本地技術詳情報告，匯總 WordPress、執行階段、快取、應用和驗收證據。不會向外部發送任何資料。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A material performance regression repeated on the confirmation pass. "
"YPerf rolled the profile back automatically."
msgstr "復核時再次檢測到明顯的效能退化。YPerf 已自動復原效能設定。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A memory engine may be available, but WordPress has not confirmed an "
"adopted persistent object-cache execution layer."
msgstr "可能存在可用的記憶體快取引擎，但 WordPress 尚未確認已啟用持久化物件快取執行層。"

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
msgid ""
"A native page-cache adoption record already exists. YPerf will not "
"activate a second page-cache executor until that authority is reviewed or"
" released."
msgstr "已存在原生頁面快取接管記錄。在審查或釋放該管理權限之前，YPerf 不會啟用第二個頁面快取執行器。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A new activation rolls back automatically if cache proof or Runtime "
"Acceptance fails."
msgstr "如果快取驗證或執行階段驗收失敗，新啟用的快取會自動復原。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A no-change planning surface built from WordPress evidence plus the "
"optional host snapshot. Explicit execution lives in the dedicated "
"adoption/operation cards and remains gated by ownership, proof and "
"rollback contracts."
msgstr ""
"一個僅用於規劃、不修改設定的界面，依據 WordPress "
"證據及可選的主機快照產生建議。實際執行須在專用的接管或運維卡片中明確操作，並受到管理歸屬、驗證和復原規則的約束。"

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"A previous adoption record exists, but current proof no longer matches or"
" is stale. Re-prove execution before treating the adoption as current."
msgstr "存在舊的接管記錄，但當前驗證結果已過期或不再匹配。重新驗證實際執行情況後，才能將接管狀態視為最新。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A provider-owned advanced-cache.php can still block blind manual removal."
" The transactional handover deactivates the provider first, reconciles "
"YPerf ownership, proves execution, and automatically restores the "
"previous provider if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"服務供應商管理的 advanced-cache.php 檔案仍可能阻止直接手動刪除。事務性交接會先停用服務供應商，核對 YPerf "
"管理歸屬，驗證執行情況；若驗證失敗，則自動恢復原服務供應商。"

msgid ""
"A provider-owned advanced-cache.php can still block blind removal. YPerf "
"prepares a reversible handoff, but you control W3 Total Cache activation "
"on the normal Plugins screen. After your confirmation, YPerf reconciles "
"ownership and proves the replacement."
msgstr ""
"服務供應商管理的 advanced-cache.php 檔案仍可能阻止直接刪除。YPerf "
"會準備可逆的交接流程，但你仍需在常規“外掛”頁面手動控制 W3 Total Cache 的啟用狀態。確認後，YPerf "
"將核對管理歸屬並驗證替換執行器。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A read-only site health check. It verifies public routes, cache safety "
"and origin behavior without changing settings."
msgstr "唯讀網站健康檢查。檢查公開頁面、快取安全性和原站行為，不修改任何設定。"

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"A score is diagnostic evidence, not a cache engine. YPerf should explain "
"why a page is slow and which layer owns the cost."
msgstr "評分是診斷證據，並不是快取引擎。YPerf 應解釋頁面為何緩慢，以及成本由哪個層級產生。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A second pass prevents one noisy sample from triggering rollback by "
"itself."
msgstr "第二輪確認可避免單次異常測量直接觸發復原。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"A technical map of YPerf and detected acceleration layers. Use Optimize "
"or Settings for normal on/off control."
msgstr "YPerf 與已檢測到的加速層級的技術概覽。常規開關請使用“最佳化”或“設定”。"

