"syntax test, read-back, Runtime Acceptance and rollback."
msgstr ""
"該協議為管理後台工作行程保留明確餘量，並記錄準確的更改前狀態。R3 可接管已安全設定的原生 max_children 上限，而不重寫 PHP-"
"FPM；將來如需修改主機，仍必須進行語法測試、回讀驗證、執行階段驗收及復原。"

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The current Redis eviction policy is not an allkeys LRU/LFU policy. "
"Adoption remains blocked pending explicit review."
msgstr "當前 Redis 淘汰策略並非 allkeys LRU/LFU 策略。在明確審查前，接管仍被阻止。"

#: includes/class-yperf-control-plane-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The current YPerf Runtime Acceptance is missing, stale or contains a "
"functional failure. Control-plane capacity is not considered releasable "
"until the site baseline is clean."
msgstr "當前 YPerf 執行階段驗收缺失、過期或含有功能性失敗。在網站基準狀態檢查通過前，不視為可釋放控制平面容量。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The current YPerf early runtime must pass before Video Lite can be "
"changed."
msgstr "更改 Video Lite 前，當前 YPerf 早期執行階段必須通過驗證。"

msgid ""
"The current YPerf early runtime must pass before media optimization can "
"be changed."
msgstr "更改媒體最佳化前，當前 YPerf 早期執行階段必須通過驗證。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The current YPerf version has clean read-only proof."
msgstr "當前 YPerf 版本的唯讀驗證全部通過。"

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
