msgstr "當前 advanced-cache.php 的管理歸屬或雜湊不明確。檔案重新整理被阻止，需人工審查。"

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The current origin probe proves BYPASS rather than HIT, so there is "
