msgstr "當前原站探測結果為 BYPASS 而非 HIT，因此尚無可以安全接管的活動頁面快取執行器。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The deeper check only adds localhost service reachability and optional "
"capability confirmation; it is not an installation step."
msgstr "深入檢查僅額外執行本地服務可連接性檢測和可選功能確認；它不是安裝步驟。"

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The delivery engine is route-aware, skips cart/checkout/account and "
"logged-in traffic, preserves theme/jQuery execution, and is covered by "
"Runtime Acceptance plus automatic rollback."
msgstr "交付引擎能夠識別不同路由、跳過購物車/結算/帳戶及已登入流量、保留主題與 jQuery 執行行為，並受到執行階段驗收和自動復原保護。"

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The exact W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php is captured locally for "
"rollback before any file change."
msgstr "更改任何檔案之前，會在本地儲存準確的 W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php 副本用於復原。"

