msgstr "現有網站行程池已設定受限的工作行程上限，且當前驗收通過。YPerf 可直接接管此原生上限，無需修改 PHP-FPM。"

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The frozen Redis database or key namespace is invalid."
msgstr "已凍結的 Redis 資料庫或鍵命名空間無效。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The handover button unlocks automatically after Step 4 proves that all "
