"Runtime safety and repeat-HIT consistency before moving deeper into Redis"
" or Origin tuning."
msgstr ""
"本地 YPerf 設定已通過驗證，但尚無活動頁面快取執行器。請執行受限的頁面快取穩定性活動，驗證 MISS → "
"HIT、執行階段安全性和重複命中一致性，再深入 Redis 或原站調整。"

#: includes/class-yperf-ai-advisor.php
msgid ""
"The local YPerf safety gate lowered the AI profile because current "
"deterministic evidence does not authorize the requested level."
msgstr "由於當前確定性證據不足以批准所請求的級別，本地 YPerf 安全檢查已降低 AI 設定級別。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The local profile was applied and accepted by Runtime Acceptance."
msgstr "本地設定已應用並通過執行階段驗收。"

#: includes/class-yperf-release-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The local runtime/control-plane gates are healthy. Official WordPress "
"Plugin Check remains an external human acceptance gate and is never "
"fabricated from inside YPerf."
msgstr "本地執行階段與控制平面檢查正常。官方 WordPress Plugin Check 仍需由使用者在外部執行並驗收，YPerf 絕不會在內部偽造結果。"

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The log is local, bounded and intended for debugging invalidation storms "
"and unexpected cache churn."
msgstr "該日誌在本地儲存且數量受限，用於排查快取失效請求風暴及異常快取更新頻率。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The model catalog comes from the verified account plan; YPerf does not "
