msgstr "原生驗證證據屬於其他主機名，YPerf 不會將其用於此網站的接管。"

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The new YPerf-owned runtime must pass before migration can finalize."
msgstr "遷移完成前，新的 YPerf 自有執行階段必須通過驗證。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The next Runtime Acceptance will capture query count, database time, "
"slow-query counts and query families for origin-executed frontend probes."
msgstr "下一次執行階段驗收將記錄實際執行原站的前端探測中的查詢次數、資料庫耗時、慢查詢次數和查詢類別。"

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
