msgstr "所選 YPerf 基準設定已應用並通過執行階段驗收。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected YPerf baseline was applied, accepted by Runtime Acceptance "
"and automatically prewarmed."
msgstr "所選 YPerf 基準設定已應用、通過執行階段驗收，並已自動預熱。"

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
