"The site pool is mapped, but no live worker RSS sample is available. Do "
"not derive an Origin Budget from configuration alone."
msgstr "網站行程池已映射，但沒有工作行程 RSS 實時樣本。不要僅根據設定推算原站資源預算。"

msgid "The sitemap diagnostic stayed inside its bounded execution budget."
msgstr "網站地圖診斷未超出受限執行時間預算。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The stability metric is local same-origin cache evidence, not a Google "
"PageSpeed score. Use repeated PageSpeed runs later as an external field "
"check after YPerf has proved deterministic cache execution."
msgstr ""
"穩定性指標來自本地同源快取證據，不是 Google PageSpeed 分數。YPerf 驗證確定性的快取執行後，再通過重複 PageSpeed "
"測試進行外部現場檢查。"

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The staged object-cache drop-in failed its read-back hash check."
msgstr "待部署的物件快取直通檔案未通過回讀雜湊檢查。"

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The stored Page Cache artifact hash does not match the live file. Refresh"
" is blocked."
msgstr "儲存的頁面快取檔案雜湊與當前檔案不符。重新整理被阻止。"

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The zone is exclusive to this server block. YPerf can operate prewarm now"
" while host writes remain locked."
msgstr "快取區域由此伺服器設定塊獨佔。YPerf 現在可以進行預熱，但主機寫入仍被鎖定。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Theme contrast, accessibility styling and third-party scripts such as "
"chat widgets remain outside this write boundary. YPerf may diagnose those"
" costs later, but this campaign does not rewrite external code just to "
"improve a benchmark score."
msgstr "主題對比度、無障礙樣式及聊天掛件等第三方指令碼均不屬於此寫入範圍。YPerf 以後可以診斷這些開銷，但本活動不會只為提高基準分數而重寫外部代碼。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Think of it as PageSpeed Insights with access under the hood."
msgstr "可以將它視為能深入分析內部機制的 PageSpeed Insights。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "This YPerf capability is operated from its dedicated bounded workflow."
msgstr "此 YPerf 功能應通過其專用的受限工作流程操作。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This completed migration remains visible as history. Future YPerf updates"
" do not ask you to migrate the same provider again."
msgstr "已完成的遷移將繼續保留在歷史記錄中。未來 YPerf 更新不會要求再次遷移同一服務供應商。"

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "This file is not a supported Yablonsky Performance settings backup."
msgstr "此檔案不是受支持的 Yablonsky Performance 設定備份。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This gate turns intermittent admin incidents into explicit release/tuning"
" evidence. It never raises PHP memory, changes FPM or alters the "
"WordPress upgrader automatically."
msgstr "此檢查將間歇性後台故障轉化為明確的發佈及調整證據。它絕不會自動增加 PHP 記憶體、更改 FPM 或修改 WordPress 升級程序。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This indicator tracks site configuration and evidence — not YPerf "
"development progress."
msgstr "此指示器跟蹤網站設定與證據，而不是 YPerf 的開發進度。"

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a PHP runtime capability, not something YPerf should imitate in "
"WordPress."
msgstr "這是 PHP 執行階段提供的能力，不應由 YPerf 在 WordPress 中自行模擬。"

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a core YPerf advantage: first-hit work is treated separately from"
" repeat-hit cache."
msgstr "這是 YPerf 的核心優勢：分別處理首次訪問負載與重複快取命中請求。"

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a local low-risk optimization layer; it is intentionally separate"
" from cache and server adoption."
msgstr "這是低風險的本地最佳化層，有意與快取及伺服器接管分離。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is separate from Site Readiness. It tracks whether the detected "
"legacy provider can be retired without losing an active responsibility."
msgstr "這與網站準備度不同：它跟蹤能否在不失去活動職責的情況下安全停用舊版服務供應商。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the answer to “what is actually working?”. Detection alone never "
"gets a green ACTIVE state."
msgstr "這裡回答“哪些功能真正生效了？”僅僅檢測到功能，絕不會得到綠色的“活動中”狀態。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the first explicit local write boundary: YPerf may create only "
"its own wp-content/object-cache.php and namespaced Redis health/cache "
"keys in the reserved logical database."
msgstr ""
"這是第一個明確的本地寫入邊界：YPerf 只能在預留邏輯資料庫中創建自己的 wp-content/object-cache.php 和帶命名空間的"
" Redis 健康或快取鍵。"

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid "This provider responsibility is not supported by the guided resolver."
msgstr "引導式職責處理器不支持此服務供應商職責。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This refresh is read-only: it rechecks the environment, runs Runtime "
"Acceptance and rebuilds the performance benchmark. It does not enable "
"cache, alter providers or change host configuration."
msgstr "此重新整理是唯讀操作：重新檢查環境、執行執行階段驗收、重新產生效能基準測試。不啟用快取、不更改服務供應商或主機設定。"

#: includes/class-yperf-recommendations.php
msgid ""
"This site has enough published content for publishing workflow automation"
" to become relevant. A future Yablonsky Publisher integration can use "
"YPerf performance evidence without turning the cache dashboard into an "
"advertising surface."
msgstr ""
"此網站已發佈足夠內容，可考慮自動化發佈流程。未來 Yablonsky Publisher 集成可以利用 YPerf "
"效能證據，同時保持快取儀錶盤不變成廣告頁面。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This site-level view tracks optional Redis/native-host execution lanes "
"and provider-retirement evidence. It is informative and does not make "
"optional host features a market-release requirement."
msgstr "此網站級視圖跟蹤可選 Redis/原生主機執行通道及服務供應商停用證據。它只提供資訊，不會把可選主機功能變成市場發佈要求。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This snapshot proves only part of the native stack. Run the Host "
"Inspector bundled with the current YPerf release to capture site-specific"
" Nginx ownership, Redis isolation/headroom and exact PHP-FPM worker-"
"memory evidence."
msgstr ""
"此快照只驗證了部分原生技術棧。請執行當前 YPerf 版本內置的 Host Inspector，以採集網站專屬的 Nginx 管理歸屬、Redis"
" 隔離及剩餘容量，以及準確的 PHP-FPM 工作行程記憶體證據。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This tile is evidence only. YPerf does not claim ownership of an external"
" runtime layer."
msgstr "此卡片僅顯示證據。YPerf 不會聲稱擁有外部執行階段層。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Three frontend samples per route plus isolated Redis/Memcached localhost "
"read tests. No cache setting is changed."
msgstr "每條路由進行三次前端採樣，並單獨測試本地主機的 Redis/Memcached 讀取。不更改快取設定。"

