msgstr "YPerf 未更改任何外掛的啟用狀態。重試前請審查頁面快取管理歸屬。"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf may change"
msgstr "YPerf 可以更改"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf may execute only the dedicated local operations whose exact "
