msgid "YPerf owns only Rocket Loader OFF, HTTP/3 ON and purge synchronization."
msgstr "YPerf 僅管理 Rocket Loader 關閉、HTTP/3 開啓及快取清除同步。"

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the migrated layers and the post-handover Runtime Acceptance "
