msgstr "YPerf 已恢復自身的遷移更改。如需再次啟用 W3 Total Cache，請自行在 WordPress 的“外掛”頁面重新啟用。"

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own migration changes. W3 Total Cache remains inactive"
