"YPerf reverted every change made by this migration run, including the "
"pre-handover W3TC responsibility switches."
msgstr "YPerf 已撤銷此遷移過程中的所有更改，包括交接前 W3TC 職責開關的更改。"

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
